Set Timezone |
timedatectl set-timezone Asia/Jakarta

Set NTP CLIENT |
apt update && apt install -y systemd-timesyncd

mkdir -p /etc/systemd/timesyncd.conf.d
nano /etc/systemd/timesyncd.conf.d/ntp.conf
[Time]
NTP=0.id.pool.ntp.org 1.id.pool.ntp.org 2.id.pool.ntp.org
FallbackNTP=0.debian.pool.ntp.org 1.debian.pool.ntp.org

timedatectl set-ntp true
systemctl restart systemd-timesyncd
timedatectl timesync-status

Command buat cek |
timedatectl

Yang perlu dilihat:
System clock synchronized: yes artinya jam sudah sinkron
NTP service: active artinya service NTP berjalan
Time zone: Asia/Jakarta (WIB, +0700)
